1.1.4 Mixed tables
------------------

(%i1) regions : df_string_column(["North", "South", "East", "West"])$
(%i2) revenue : ndarray([100.0, 150.0, 120.0, 180.0])$
(%i3) T : df_table(["region", "revenue"], [regions, revenue])$
